"learning.card.gratitude.section1.content" = "Practicing gratitude isn't just \\\"positive thinking\\\": it's a scientifically validated technique that modifies your brain and stress level.\n\n• Activation of the medial prefrontal cortex (well-being)\n• Release of dopamine and serotonin (happiness)\n• Reduced amygdala activity (stress/fear)\n• -23% cortisol on average";
